ls in the midst of the netherworld,"}, {"number": "3", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n aš-(š)rigingal | bēlti (||) kaqqiri | rabīti!\n// cf. L I.8 MA \"-\" 1", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "12", "atf": "aš₂-ri-gi-in-gal be-el-ti kaq-qi₂-ri GAL-tu₄#", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: To Ereškigal, the lady of the great land,"}, {"number": "4", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n ana ištar | āšibat (||) qerbi (|) erkalli\n// L I.8 MA \"-\" 2", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "13", "atf": "a-na {d}15 a-ši-bat qer-bi er-kal-li", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": true, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: To Ishtar who dwells in the midst of the netherworld,"}, {"number": "5", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n bīt (|) erkalli || ša ālikūtūšu | lā tayyār[ū]\n// cf. L I.8 SB \"-\" 5\n// cf. L I.8 SB \"-\" 6\n// cf. L I.8 MA \"-\" 11", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "14", "atf": "E₂ er-kal-li ša₂ a-li-ku-tu-šu₂ la ta-a-a-r[u]", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: To the seat of the netherworld, that none leaves who enters,"}, {"number": "6", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n ašru | nūru || lā šakin | nišīš[u]", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "15", "atf": "aš-ru nu-ru la ša₂-kin₂ UN-MEŠ-š[u]", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": true, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: The place where light is not available to its inhabitants,"}, {"number": "7", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n ašru | mītūssu || sahhupū | ina epri", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "16", "atf": "aš-ru mi-tu-su sah-hu-pu ina ep-ri", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: The place whose dead are covered in dust,"}, {"number": "8", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n <b>īt | ekleti! || kakkabu | ul uṣ(ṣ)â", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "17", "atf": "<bi>-it ek-le-tu₂ MUL ul u₂-ṣa-a", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": true, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: The house of darkness, where no star comes forth,"}, {"number": "9", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n mārat (|) sîn || uzunša | iptē-ma\n// cf. L I.8 SB \"-\" 2", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "18", "atf": "DUMU.MUNUS {d}30 u₂-zu-un-ša₂ ip-te-ma", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: The daughter of Sin set her mind."}, {"number": "10", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n iptē-ma | uzunša! | ušaškin\n// cf. L I.8 SB \"-\" 3", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "19", "atf": "ip-te-ma u₂-za-an-ša₂ u₂-ša₂-aš₂-kin₂", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": true, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: Her mind she set and coveted (it),"}, {"number": "11", "oldLineNumbers": [], "variants": [{"reconstruction": "%n ša ālikūtūša | lā tayyārū\n// cf. L I.8 SB \"-\" 5\n// cf. L I.8 SB \"-\" 6\n// cf. L I.8 MA \"-\" 5", "manuscripts": [{"manuscriptId": 1, "labels": ["r"], "number": "20", "atf": "ša₂# a-li-ku-u₂-tu₂-ša₂ la ta-a-ru-u₂\n$ end of excerpt\n$ single ruling\n$ 1 line blank\n$ end of side", "omittedWords": []}], "intertext": ""}], "isSecondLineOfParallelism": false, "isBeginningOfSection": false, "translation": "#tr.en: (The place) that none leaves who enters,"}], "record": {"authors": [{"name": "Setälä", "prefix": "Albert", "role": "EDITOR", "orcidNumber": "0000-0002-4948-1349"}, {"name": "Földi", "prefix": "Zsombor J.", "role": "REVISION", "orcidNumber": "0000-0001-9976-899X"}, {"name": "Hätinen", "prefix": "Aino", "role": "REVISION", "orcidNumber": "0000-0002-7039-5496"}, {"name": "Jiménez", "prefix": "Enrique", "role": "REVISION", "orcidNumber": "0000-0003-0093-528X"}, {"name": "Rozzi", "prefix": "Geraldina", "role": "REVISION", "orcidNumber": "0000-0002-1072-2512"}], "translators": [{"name": "Foster", "prefix": "Benjamin R.", "orcidNumber": "", "language": "en"}], "publicationDate": "2022-11-29T17:58:21.357308"}, "parserVersion": "6.1.0", "isFilteredQuery": false, "colophonLinesInQuery": {}}